comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-25T00:18:21.933Z",codex-root,"Starting only this concrete task; Feature hac-r2z9 and Plan hac-1sdd stay open, not in progress."
  "2026-07-25T00:29:47.990Z",codex-root,"Focused TypeScript, ESLint, file-size, 119/119 docstrings, 96 WebSocket tests, recursive help, built live trigger subscription, and built live ping pass. Proceeding to full four-metric and release verification."
  "2026-07-25T00:39:33.591Z",codex-root,Mandatory dependency gate discovered GHSA-mh99-v99m-4gvg. Canonical remediation is tracked by hac-jo1v; override and lock now resolve patched brace-expansion 5.0.8 and bun audit is clean.
  "2026-07-25T01:03:41.340Z",codex-root,"Final PM-linked acceptance is green: package-installed npx/bunx, focused 73-test WebSocket suite, live read-only Home Assistant smoke, and complete release verifier. Modern trigger-key syntax was additionally verified against live Home Assistant 2026.4.4. Preparing the review branch and exact-head hosted checks."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-25T00:18:21.933Z",codex-root,The live acceptance trigger uses a synthetic event type and does not fire or mutate Home Assistant.
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-25T00:18:21.933Z",codex-root,subscribe_trigger is admin-only and uses unsubscribe_events with the original subscription id.
